    "text": "1 days ago AUBURNDALE – No. 6 seed Auburndale had its hands full with No. 11 Neillsville, but survived a fifth-set match 3-2 in a WIAA Division 4 girls volleyball regional quarterfinal Tuesday night at Auburndale High School. Auburndale survived 25-11, 23-25, 26-24, 27-29, 15-12, to advance to Division 4 regional semifinal... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
